  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Letter\n I\n J\n K\n L\n \n \n\n Stands For\n +\n ×\n ÷\n –\n \n \n\nGiven: (35 L 19) J 4 I 26 L (7 J 3) I 11 = ?\n\n(35 L 19) J 4 I 26 L (7 J 3) I 11 = ? ⇒ (35 - 19) × 4 + 26 - (7 × 3) + 11 = ?\n\n⇒ __**(35 - 19)**__ × 4 + 26 - __**(7 **____**×**____** 3)**__ + 11 = ?\n\n⇒ __**16 ×**____** 4**__ + 26 - 21 + 11 = ?\n\n⇒ __**6**____**4 + 26 + 11**__ - 21 = ?\n\n⇒ __**10**____1__ - 21 = ?\n\n⇒ **80 = ?**\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
